MtMoon_Text_BrockFirstMeeting::
	.string "Hey, watch your step. These tunnels\n"
	.string "are unstable... but that's where the\l"
	.string "good finds are.\p"
	.string "You're not just passing through,\n"
	.string "are you?\p"
	.string "You've got that look...\n"
	.string "like you're searching for something.\p"
	.string "This place is full of them-\n"
	.string "fragments of ancient POKéMON.\p"
	.string "One fragment on its own doesn't\n"
	.string "tell you much...\l"
	.string "but combine the right ones...\p"
	.string "...and you might get something close\n"
	.string "to what used to live here.\p"
	.string "If you find a fossil around\n"
	.string "here, show it to me.\l"
	.string "I'd like to see what you're made of!$"

MtMoon_Text_BrockStillSearching::
	.string "Still searching?\n"
	.string "Keep your eyes on the ground.\p"
	.string "MT. MOON has a way of hiding\n"
	.string "history in plain sight.$"

MtMoon_Text_BrockSawHelixShard::
	.string "That's a HELIX FOSSIL!\p"
	.string "Sharp ridges... light structure...\n"
	.string "This belonged to something built\l"
	.string "for speed.\p"
	.string "Good eye. You found something\n"
	.string "with real historical value.$"

MtMoon_Text_BrockGaveDartShard::
	.string "BROCK gave you a\n"
	.string "DART FOSSIL.$"

MtMoon_Text_BrockSawDomeShard::
	.string "That's a DOME FOSSIL!\p"
	.string "Dense curve... strong shell...\n"
	.string "This belonged to something built\l"
	.string "to endure.\p"
	.string "Good eye. You found something\n"
	.string "with real historical value.$"

MtMoon_Text_BrockGaveHasteShard::
	.string "BROCK gave you a\n"
	.string "HASTE FOSSIL.$"

MtMoon_Text_BrockReturnToGym::
	.string "You've got a good eye.\p"
	.string "Meet me back at the PEWTER GYM.\n"
	.string "There's something I want to show\l"
	.string "you about evolution.$"
